s I want to watch some random Arab guy starting with the letter A... please fix that... And the only upgrade i really need is the ability to put my positions in folders.. for my current stock positions.. since I'm a swing trader I need to have a good overview of Long positions and my Short positions. As well as long time short term.. and when I look at either ones I dont want the other ones to be in the way.. also I need to put my positions that I want to really go long with in a \"future winners\" folder.. and also have a short version \"future loosers\"... I dont need all the \"lull-lull\" overworked GUI.. just a simple one that we had.. but other than that.. great work guys!!.. ","languageCode":"en-gb"},"attachments":[],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None","id":"0a245f8e-b788-40be-a4b3-89e700541753","owner":{"id":"22269569","username":"XtraderXtraderX","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/21986141/1.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/21986141/1.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/21986141/1.jpg"},"roles":["Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":true,"countryCode":196,"piLevel":0,"isProInvestor":false,"badgeType":"None"},"obsoleteId":"0a245f8e-b788-40be-a4b3-89e700541753","parent":{"id":"6011e790-b8ba-11f1-8080-80002ed9c48c","obsoleteId":"6011e790-b8ba-11f1-8080-80002ed9c48c","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-25T12:49:11.814Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":2},"emotions":[{"type":"Like","id":"like_0a245f8e-b788-40be-a4b3-89e700541753_28036429","owner":{"id":"28036429","username":"KrejzekEmil","firstName":"Emil","lastName":"Krejzek","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/27753756/13.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/27753756/13.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/27753756/13.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":fa