/shows/market-pulse-the-daily-voice/dv649-are-yields-getting-out-of-control-oracle-struggles-but-costco-shows-us-the-consumer-isnt-dead-25th-september","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-25T08:30:10.886Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://omny.fm/shows/market-pulse-the-daily-voice/dv649-are-yields-getting-out-of-control-oracle-struggles-but-costco-shows-us-the-consumer-isnt-dead-25th-september","title":"DV649 - Are yields getting out of control, Oracle struggles, But Costco shows us the consumer isn't dead - 25th September - Market Pulse: The Daily Voice","host":"omny.fm","description":"Welcome to \"The Daily Voice\" - eToro's daily financial outlook\n\nIn this podcast, you'll receive valuable insights from eToro's Market Analyst, Sam North on the significant daily financial news, all within a concise time frame of under 5 minutes.\n\nIn today’s episode of The Daily Voice, Sam reviews the main headlines from yesterday and previews the day ahead.\n\nMARKET BITES EPISODE\n\nFANTASY FOOTBALL LEAGUE\n\nMake sure you subscribe and follow eToro on social media: 👇\n\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@etoro?sub_confirmation=1\neToro's platform: https://www.etoro.com/\nFacebook: https://www.face...","mediaType":"Link","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":630,"url":"https://omny.fm/shows/market-pulse-the-daily-voice/dv649-are-yields-getting-out-of-control-oracle-struggles-but-costco-shows-us-the-consumer-isnt-dead-25th-september/image.jpg?t=1781266933&size=wideShare"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None"},"commentsData":{"reactionPaging":{"totalCount":0},"comments":[]},"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":2},"emotions":[{"type":"Like","id":"like_52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2_12564565","owner":{"id":"12564565","username":"FxTradeFx","firstName":"Lars","lastName":"Nietzschmann","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/12276068/5.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/12276068/5.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/12276068/5.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":79,"piLevel":2,"isProInvestor":false,"badgeType":"Pi"},"parent":{"id":"52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2","obsoleteId":"52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-25T18:55:12.265Z"},{"type":"Like","id":"like_52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2_10671550","owner":{"id":"10671550","username":"Miyoshi","firstName":"Victor","lastName":"Pedersen","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/10383817/31.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/10383817/31.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/10383817/31.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":57,"piLevel":5,"isProInvestor":false,"badgeType":"Pi"},"parent":{"id":"52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2","obsoleteId":"52918660-b8bb-11f1-8080-8000566a31a2","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-25T13:02:10.606Z"}]}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":true,"isOwner":false},"summary":{"totalCommentsAndReplies":0,"sharedCount":0}},{"id":"3c6c7380-b89e-11f1-8080-800107a310e3","post":{"id":"3c6c7380-b89e-11f1-8080-800107a310e3","owner":{"id":"318149","username":"eToroTeam","firstName":"eToro","lastName":"Team","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/918269/11.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/918269/11.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/918269/11.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","Analyst","Verified","Regular","Admin","Moderator","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":250,"piLevel":0,"isProInvestor":false,"badgeType":"None"},"obsoleteId":"30bb87ea-67cf-4e6a-8400-065461edddba","created":"2026-09-25T05:01:58.328Z","message":{"text":"🚨 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐭 𝐍𝐨𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐞 - 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 of the following stock due to a merger/acquisition (M&A):\n\n● Just Eat Takeaway.com NV-ADR - $JTKWY\n\nThe above-mentioned stock was recently involved in a merger/acquisition and will be delisted from the exchange.\n\nA merger involves the combination of two companies into a single new entity. Various types of mergers are executed for different reasons, such as expanding a company's presence in new sectors or gaining market share. The ultimate goal behind such mergers and acquisitions is to enhance shareholder value.\n\nIf the aforementioned stock is the acquired party, then it will be delisted from the platform, and positions will be closed at the average liquidation price. If the aforementioned stock is the acquirer, it will continue to be offered on our platform.\n\nPlease be aware that corporate actions may be subject to changes.\n\nTo review your account portfolio and stay informed about any updates, please click here: https://www.etoro.com/portfolio/overview\n\n\nThank you,\n\nThe eToroTeam","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-25T05:01:58.328Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/df4362b1-546a-4f51-bc8e-25621a4a79d2-2026-09-25.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/df4362b1-546a-4f51-bc8e-25621a4a79d2-2026-09-25.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"8693","symbolName":"JTKWY","displayName":"Just Eat Takeaway.com NV-ADR","updated":"2026-09-25T11:21:36.501Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":8693,"avatar":{"small":"htt